# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) for local Django:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8001/api
#
# Optional: LAN / phone testing when env still points at localhost (see lib/api-url.ts):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_PORT=8001
#
# Production URL is set in `.env.production` for `next build` / `next start`.
